{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51948","headline":"吕剑留泉 · 吕岩","name":"吕剑留泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五百年前此地来，碧桃移向石坛栽。\n三春绿柳千条缕，万线清泉一剑开。\n红日照残新殿阁，白云堆破旧楼台。\n昔年踪迹今何在？尚有余霞点翠苔。\n（同上一二八八《靖州部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}